{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistencePlugin"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/DesignPrinciples","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PluginArchitecture","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistenceMiddlewareGuide","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/ArchitectureGuide","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/BuildingYourFirstApp","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/HowToAddPersistence"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After each reducer call, drains ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ChangeSet"},{"type":"text","text":"s from registered "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateWriter"},{"type":"text","text":" buffers. Restarts a debounce timer on each drain. When the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timer fires, flushes all pending writes in a single "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Task"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A flush whose save fails is retried on a doubling backoff, bounded by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/RetryPolicy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Without that a failed save is silent data loss: the buffers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are cleared at flush time, so the write would only ever reach storage if the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user happened to touch the same entity again. Running out of attempts is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported through the writer rather than passing in silence, and the batch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stays pending so a later edit or an explicit "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin\/flush()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tries once more."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wiring","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Wiring"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let persistence = PersistencePlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","    writers: [","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.decks) { writes, deletes in ... },","        StateWriter(keyPath: \\.cards) { writes, deletes in ... },","    ],","    debounce: .milliseconds(250)",")","plugins.register(persistence)"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/persistenceplugin"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Coalescing persistence plugin.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/SwiduxPlugin","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Swidux\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/PersistencePlugin"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","externalID":"s:6Swidux17PersistencePluginC","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PersistencePlugin"}],"role":"symbol","title":"PersistencePlugin","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Pe